# Code owners of this hub on Gitea and Forgejo. A merge here turns into a pull
# request in every target, so every change to these paths needs a review by
# the hub's maintainers. Replace @acme/hub-maintainers with your team, and
# turn on code owner approval in the default branch's protection rule.
# Unlike GitHub and GitLab, each rule here is a Go regular expression matched
# against the file's path; [.] matches a literal dot without the backslash
# escaping this file needs otherwise.

packs/.*              @acme/hub-maintainers
hub[.]yml             @acme/hub-maintainers
targets[.]yml         @acme/hub-maintainers
[.]touchmark/.*       @acme/hub-maintainers
[.]github/.*          @acme/hub-maintainers
[.]gitlab-ci[.]yml    @acme/hub-maintainers
[.]gitlab/.*          @acme/hub-maintainers
[.]gitea/.*           @acme/hub-maintainers
renovate[.]json       @acme/hub-maintainers
scripts/.*            @acme/hub-maintainers
